Z||000004||Dave Gunsul||08-08-2001||03:36 PM||||If you want to spend the big bucks you can always go here for the Borla exh.: <A HREF="http://www.fieroparts.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fieroparts.com</A> <P>IRM sells a dual exhaust that eliminates the muffler. It is made of stainless too.<BR>Costs $220.00. <P>The Fiero store sells the Ocelot performance exhaust, this is not stainless. $269.95 with <BR>tips.<P>I know you're probably only looking for a muffler but I thought i'd show some other choices that you could do as well.<P>------------------<BR>Dave Gunsul<BR>N.I.F.E. member<BR>86 GT modified<BR>85 SE daily driver||||reg||1
