Z||000012||MinnGreenGT||08-09-2001||10:28 AM||||Muffler?  Who needs a muffler?  I'm running a custom exhaust that I had built at a Local Car-X.  I ported my exhaust mainfolds myself-not difficult at all, just takes time.  Then had Car-X build the new system: High-Flow Cat, 2.5" Piping back to a Y-split, then finished with a pair of Pacesetter Monza dual resonator tips (in gold to match the car).  It Flows. It's Loud.  I Love it.<P>I've also looked at the exhaust system availbe through "fieroheaven" but I can't find them on the web anymore?!? They had a newly designed set of headers and a complete stainless exhaust system built by B&B (they do stuff for Porsche). Nice stuff, but can't find them anymore.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/grngt.jpg">  <P>Medium Metallic Green 87 GT<BR>3.1L High Output<BR>4 Spd OD Tranny<BR>Open (read: Loud) Exhaust<BR>and More!<BR>-Rob Bartlett||||reg||1
